          "id": "character:1308:1308:sequence:3:0",
          "name": "Don't Sweat Your Six!",
          "description": "Rebecca's Resonance Liberation - Party 'til Dawn!, and Resonance Liberation - BOOM! Fireworks! gain 60% DMG Multiplier increase.\nRebecca's Resonance Liberation - Party 'til Dawn! gains 30% more explosion range.\nCasting Intro Skill - Yo, It's Big Boomin' Time! or Intro Skill - Hey, Leadhead, Come 'n' Get Me! grants 120 points of Hot Hand.",
          "sourceId": "character:1308:1308:sequence:3:0",
